# Evolution — environment template. Copy to .env and fill in what you use.
# NEVER commit .env. Only variable NAMES are ever recorded in telemetry.

# --- PRIMARY ROUTE: NVIDIA NIM ---------------------------------------------
# This is the one to set. NIM leads every role chain, and it is the only
# provider here whose models were probed individually with a real key.
# VERIFIED with a real key on 2026-08-28. Five of the nine configured ids serve;
# the other four returned a hang, a 400, a 404 entitlement error and a standing
# 429. `nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b` answered in 732 ms with tools, the
# fastest working route measured on any provider here. See HANDOFF §4i for the
# full table -- including the two catalogue ids that differ by transposed words
# where only one is real.
NVIDIA_API_KEY=

# --- Keyless fallback: OpenCode Zen ----------------------------------------
# NO KEY IS NEEDED. Zen serves nemotron-3-ultra-free, hy3-free,
# laguna-s-2.1-free and nemotron-3.5-lightning-free with no Authorization
# header at all (verified 2026-08-26), which is what makes leading with a
# key-gated primary safe: with no NVIDIA_API_KEY the NIM routes are filtered
# out and these serve instead, so the shipped configuration works as-is.
#
# A key here unlocks Zen's paid models on the same endpoint. Free routes carry
# no permanence guarantee — the provider doctor probes availability and tool
# support at runtime rather than trusting this file.
OPENCODE_API_KEY=

# --- Catalogue providers (all optional) ------------------------------------
# Declared in configs/oe_max/providers.yaml. Each is key-gated: without its
# variable the provider is inert and never enters a routing chain, so leaving
# every line below empty is a supported configuration.
#
# Model ids are NOT configured for these — they are discovered from each
# provider's own listing, so setting a key is all that is required.
GROQ_API_KEY=
CEREBRAS_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
MISTRAL_API_KEY=
HF_TOKEN=
SAMBANOVA_API_KEY=
MODELSCOPE_API_KEY=
CHUTES_API_KEY=
ZAI_API_KEY=
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=
SILICONFLOW_API_KEY=
NEBIUS_API_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
MOONSHOT_API_KEY=
MINIMAX_API_KEY=

# --- Other OpenAI-compatible providers (optional) --------------------------
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Local OpenAI-compatible endpoint (optional) --------------------------
# EVOLUTION_LOCAL_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1
# EVOLUTION_LOCAL_MODEL=qwen2.5-coder

# --- Control plane --------------------------------------------------------
# EVOLUTION_HOST=127.0.0.1
# EVOLUTION_PORT=8000
# EVOLUTION_CLASSIC_PORT=8080
# EVOLUTION_WORKSPACE=./.evolution/workspace
